        "is_explicit": false,
        "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:33:36.126990",
        "detail": "Now, let's dive into the magic behind 'Crazy in Love'. Did you know that the iconic horn riff was sampled from The Chi-Lites' 'Are You My Woman (Tell Me So)'? It was a last-minute addition that transformed the track into an instant classic. The song was co-written by Beyonc\u00e9, her future husband Jay-Z, and producer Rich Harrison. They recorded it in just two hours, capturing the raw energy that you can still feel today. And that, my friends, is the power of spontaneity in music. Keep it locked right here for more behind-the-scenes stories!"
